"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunktrackr_docs=globalThis.webpackChunktrackr_docs||[]).push([[567],{3612(n){n.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"trackr-v1.2-launch","metadata":{"permalink":"/trackr/blog/trackr-v1.2-launch","editUrl":"https://github.com/mrsamdev/trackr/tree/main/docs/blog/2025-05-14-trackr-v1.2-launch.md","source":"@site/blog/2025-05-14-trackr-v1.2-launch.md","title":"Trackr v1.2: OAuth 2.1 & Enhanced MCP Integration","description":"Author: Sam O.","date":"2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release","permalink":"/trackr/blog/tags/release"},{"inline":true,"label":"oauth","permalink":"/trackr/blog/tags/oauth"},{"inline":true,"label":"mcp","permalink":"/trackr/blog/tags/mcp"}],"readingTime":2.06,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"Sam O.","title":"Maintainer","url":"https://github.com/mrsamdev","imageURL":"https://github.com/mrsamdev.png","key":"samo","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"trackr-v1.2-launch","title":"Trackr v1.2: OAuth 2.1 & Enhanced MCP Integration","authors":["samo"],"tags":["release","oauth","mcp"]},"unlisted":false},"content":"> **Author**: Sam O.\\n\\nWe\'re excited to announce Trackr v1.2.0, featuring OAuth 2.1 support for secure AI assistant integration and an enhanced analytics dashboard.\\n\\n## What\'s New\\n\\n### \ud83d\udd10 OAuth 2.1 for MCP\\n\\nThe biggest addition in v1.2 is OAuth 2.1 support for MCP (Model Context Protocol) clients. This means:\\n\\n- **Secure authentication** for AI assistants like Claude and Cursor\\n- **Token-based access** with automatic refresh\\n- **Scoped permissions** for fine-grained control\\n- **Industry-standard** OAuth 2.1 compliance\\n\\nConnect your AI assistant securely:\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"mcpServers\\": {\\n    \\"trackr\\": {\\n      \\"command\\": \\"bun\\",\\n      \\"args\\": [\\"run\\", \\"src/mcp-applications.ts\\"],\\n      \\"auth\\": \\"oauth\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### \ud83d\udcca Enhanced Analytics Dashboard\\n\\nThe analytics dashboard now features:\\n\\n- **Interactive charts** with hover details\\n- **Time range filtering** (7/30/90 days, custom)\\n- **Export capabilities** (PNG, SVG, CSV)\\n- **Mobile-responsive** design\\n- **Keyboard shortcuts** for power users\\n\\n### \u2328\ufe0f Keyboard Shortcuts\\n\\nNavigate Trackr faster with new keyboard shortcuts:\\n\\n| Key | Action |\\n|-----|--------|\\n| `n` | New application |\\n| `/` | Search |\\n| `t` | Change time range (analytics) |\\n| `e` | Export data |\\n| `?` | Show all shortcuts |\\n\\n## Migration Guide\\n\\n### For Existing Users\\n\\nIf you\'re upgrading from v1.1:\\n\\n1. **Backup your database:**\\n   ```bash\\n   cp trackr.db trackr.db.backup\\n   ```\\n\\n2. **Install dependencies:**\\n   ```bash\\n   bun install\\n   ```\\n\\n3. **Run migrations:**\\n   ```bash\\n   bun run db:migrate\\n   ```\\n\\n4. **Update OAuth settings** (if using MCP):\\n   - Regenerate GitHub OAuth credentials\\n   - Update `.env` with new secrets\\n\\n### For New Users\\n\\nGet started in minutes:\\n\\n```bash\\ngit clone https://github.com/mrsamdev/trackr.git\\ncd trackr\\nbun install\\nbun run dev\\n```\\n\\nVisit [Getting Started](/trackr/docs/getting-started/installation) for detailed setup instructions.\\n\\n## MCP Integration Examples\\n\\nWith OAuth 2.1, you can now ask your AI assistant:\\n\\n```\\n\\"List all my job applications in interview status\\"\\n\\"Add a new application for Senior Engineer at Acme Corp\\"\\n\\"Update the Google application to offer stage\\"\\n\\"Show me applications I haven\'t heard back from in 2 weeks\\"\\n```\\n\\nSee the [MCP Integration Guide](/trackr/docs/guides/mcp-integration) for setup details.\\n\\n## Performance Improvements\\n\\n- **30% faster** analytics queries with new indexes\\n- **50% smaller** bundle size after tree-shaking\\n- **Improved caching** for frequently accessed data\\n\\n## Bug Fixes\\n\\n- Fixed OAuth callback URL mismatch\\n- Resolved analytics chart rendering on mobile\\n- Corrected database migration order\\n- Fixed session expiration handling\\n\\n## What\'s Next\\n\\nComing in v1.3:\\n\\n- \ud83d\udce7 Email notifications for status changes\\n- \ud83d\udd14 Browser push notifications\\n- \ud83d\udcf1 Progressive Web App (PWA) support\\n- \ud83c\udf10 Internationalization (i18n)\\n- \ud83c\udfaf Smart suggestions for application updates\\n\\n## Feedback\\n\\nWe\'d love to hear your feedback! \\n\\n- \ud83d\udc1b [Report a bug](https://github.com/mrsamdev/trackr/issues)\\n- \ud83d\udca1 [Request a feature](https://github.com/mrsamdev/trackr/issues)\\n- \ud83d\udcac [Join the discussion](https://github.com/mrsamdev/trackr/discussions)\\n\\n## Credits\\n\\nThanks to all contributors who made this release possible!\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Full changelog:** [CHANGELOG.md](/trackr/docs/community/changelog)\\n\\n**Documentation:** [trackr.mrsamdev.github.io](https://mrsamdev.github.io/trackr/)"}]}}')}}]);